---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="How to Make an Insurance Claim in Cambodia | AG Cambodia"
  description="At AG Cambodia, we make claims simple. We handle the paperwork and follow up with your insurer so you get paid quickly. Claims support available 24/7."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>Claims</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Claims</p>
      <h1>Claim Process with AG Cambodia</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">At AG Cambodia, we make the claiming process as simple as possible for you. We handle all your claim requests and follow up with insurers until your refund.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Start a Claim</a>
        <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">24/7 Emergency Line</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Claim process -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2>Leave it with us</h2>
        <p>At AG Cambodia, we make the claiming process as simple as possible for you. We handle all your claim requests and follow up with insurers until your refund.</p>
        <p>Being fundamentally service oriented, you can leave your claim at our office and we'll process and finalize it with insurers within two weeks.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Start a Claim</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>Our claims promise</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Full claim handling from start to finish</li>
          <li>Direct follow-up with your insurer</li>
          <li>Finalized within 2 weeks</li>
          <li>Service-oriented, hassle-free process</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Emergency assistance -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">24/7 support</p>
      <h2>Emergency Assistance</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Our 24/7 assistance service provides you with immediate support in case of emergency. You can call directly our senior manager, who will respond to your urgent situation promptly.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Always On</span>
          <h3>24/7 Immediate Support</h3>
          <p>Call directly our senior manager, who will respond to your urgent situation promptly, any time, day or night.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 11h16v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 11V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Hospitalization</span>
          <h3>Direct Hospital Settlement</h3>
          <p>We link with insurance companies to obtain direct settlement of your hospitalization, working closely with doctors and hospitals for prompt confirmation of cover.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.5 3.5 6 3.5 9s-1 6.5-3.5 9c-2.5-2.5-3.5-6-3.5-9s1-6.5 3.5-9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Evacuation</span>
          <h3>Evacuation &amp; Repatriation</h3>
          <p>We monitor evacuations and repatriations with a fast response time, sending you to the best adapted facility when care isn't available in Cambodia.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="notice-box">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2 3 6v6c0 5 3.8 8.7 9 10 5.2-1.3 9-5 9-10V6l-9-4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        <p><strong>Your local broker, always by your side.</strong> With AG Cambodia you benefit from the support of your local broker, making claiming as convenient as possible. Rest easy: we handle every claim and request with care.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Need help now?</p>
        <h2>We're here when you need us</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Whether you're filing a claim or requesting a new quote, our local team responds in real time, not through a call centre.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>24/7 emergency assistance for urgent situations</li>
          <li>Claims followed up and finalized within 2 weeks</li>
          <li>Direct relationships with every major insurer</li>
          <li>Evacuation &amp; repatriation support when needed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your needs and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
